  "truthBoundary": "A57 can execute and verify one bounded, test-payment-only controlled canary after independently anchored A55 and A56 evidence. It enforces a maximum 25-participant cohort, maximum 10 Stripe test transactions, independent telemetry/support/payment/outcome/security surfaces, strict stop rules, immediate kill switch, compensating rollback, source immutability and an append-only journal. A successful run proves only this bounded staging canary lifecycle. It does not prove unrestricted production traffic, production payments, customer willingness-to-pay, continuous monitoring, contractual SLA, LIVE, production readiness or sale eligibility."
